This project is based on the Sesame Robot by Dorian (https://github.com/dorianborian/sesame-robot),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original:
- firmware/SesameRobot_Custom*: the original firmware adapted to our ESP32 DevKit pins, per-servo
  safe angle limits and OLED pins, plus small fixes and extra moves.
- firmware/TROJAN_Robot*: new firmware written from scratch (walking engine, moves, faces, web remote).
- cad/sesame-esp32: the original Sesame ESP32 CAD, unchanged.
- cad/experiments: our own scaled-up body experiment, not part of the original.
